Subject: [PATCH 1427/3799] soh: rename func_80A454CC -> EnGo2_SetIdleAnimation

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: picks the per-variant idle animation to settle into once the Goron has finished uncurling, including Biggoron's trade-dependent poses.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go2/z_en_go2.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go2/z_en_go2.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go2/z_en_go2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go2/z_en_go2.c
index 440956b0d..09a0d0dce 100644
